Package: koon
Title: Browser-Impersonating HTTP Client
Version: 1.1.0
URL: https://github.com/scrape-hub/koon
BugReports: https://github.com/scrape-hub/koon/issues
Authors@R: person("scrape-hub", email = "263154123+scrape-hub@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: HTTP client that connects like a real browser: the TLS, HTTP/2
    and HTTP/3 fingerprints of Chrome, Firefox, Safari, Edge, Opera, Brave,
    Samsung Internet and OkHttp, on desktop and mobile, checked against
    captures from the real browsers.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
